<b>Konkon</b>

03:48.840 --> 03:50.690
Butsu-metsu.

04:06.470 --> 04:07.970
Sen

04:06.640 --> 04:07.970
ko

04:06.810 --> 04:07.970
ken

04:20.070 --> 04:22.620
Slam!

04:21.570 --> 04:22.820
Graaawaaamdogyaaan

04:38.330 --> 04:46.600
Natsuko! Natsuko! Natsuko! Natsuko!

04:45.160 --> 04:46.600
What are you doing?

04:46.970 --> 04:50.010
I'm getting showered with praise.

04:51.600 --> 04:52.610
What?

04:52.610 --> 04:53.590
What?

04:56.680 --> 04:58.090
What is this?

04:59.360 --> 05:05.710
Once again, the Voids were destroyed 
without a single casualty on our side!

05:05.710 --> 05:08.600
And it's thanks to you all!

05:08.600 --> 05:10.860
Well, I <i>am</i> pretty fast at my job.

05:11.100 --> 05:14.190
When the next Void shows up,
 I'll defeat it in two seconds flat.

05:14.190 --> 05:16.290
We produce reliability and results:

05:16.930 --> 05:18.450
Nine...

05:18.800 --> 05:20.000
Soldiers!

05:22.810 --> 05:26.430
Glory to the Nine Soldiers!

05:28.030 --> 05:29.180
Seriously?

05:29.530 --> 05:34.300
"We produce reliability 
and results: Nine Soldiers!"

05:34.300 --> 05:35.430
My ass.

05:35.640 --> 05:39.950
Well, I figure a sentai hero series 
should have poses, you know?

05:40.360 --> 05:42.440
I used to love those when I was a kid.

05:42.720 --> 05:47.120
All your grandstanding lately is 
becoming a nuisance to everyone.

05:47.120 --> 05:51.010
This is going in a completely 
different direction from the movie,

05:51.010 --> 05:55.090
but I still know immediately what to draw 
even when a Void I've never seen shows up.

05:57.450 --> 05:59.640
Seriously, I'm unmatched.

05:59.640 --> 06:01.970
Are you even listening to me?

06:07.410 --> 06:10.190
Does one literally get "showered" with praise?

06:10.520 --> 06:12.350
Man, I'm starving.

06:12.350 --> 06:14.540
Hey, whatcha making?

06:14.540 --> 06:17.480
Ooh, right out of the oven. Down the hatch!

06:17.480 --> 06:19.150
Don't eat those yet!

06:22.100 --> 06:22.990
So yummy!

06:26.000 --> 06:26.980
Hm?

06:27.280 --> 06:32.480
Move away. Move away.

06:32.480 --> 06:34.750
Don't get closer!

06:34.750 --> 06:38.260
Move away.

06:35.750 --> 06:41.040
But you're always telling Luke to 
fall in love and mess around more.

06:41.040 --> 06:45.480
There are plenty of other women out there. 
Why does it have to be her?

06:45.480 --> 06:49.520
But he's definitely changed 
ever since Natsuko showed up.

06:49.520 --> 06:52.270
I've never seen Luke like that.

06:53.270 --> 06:55.900
That's exactly what I don't like about it.

06:56.530 --> 06:59.280
Nacchan!

06:59.280 --> 07:03.780
Dear members of Nine Soldiers,
 thank you for coming.

07:03.780 --> 07:07.610
Oh, Destiny. Looking as ripped as ever.

07:07.610 --> 07:09.790
Well, I'm training every day.

07:09.790 --> 07:13.980
I still think I prefer the old you, Destiny.

07:13.980 --> 07:17.650
Well, I love my current self.

07:18.410 --> 07:19.430
Awesome.

07:19.430 --> 07:21.290
Thanks, Nacchan.

07:21.290 --> 07:23.350
I'm really starting to see results.

07:23.350 --> 07:25.140
Yeah, you're literally glowing.

07:25.140 --> 07:26.330
Right?

07:27.110 --> 07:33.370
The children who live in the slums don't have 
parents or homes, and many turn to crime.

07:33.370 --> 07:38.420
That's why I want to tell them about 
Serval Cat House when we deliver food to them.

07:38.750 --> 07:41.000
That's the orphanage you built, right?

07:41.000 --> 07:44.930
The kids in the slums don't trust adults,
 so they usually run away,

07:45.240 --> 07:49.500
but I think they'll listen 
to the Nine Soldiers.

07:49.500 --> 07:51.030
Leave it to us.

07:51.030 --> 07:53.950
We should probably split up.

07:55.020 --> 07:59.080
The children in the District 
of Despair are extra cautious,

07:59.080 --> 08:01.480
so we'll need the kids' favorite.

08:01.480 --> 08:05.010
Nope! That's the last place I ever wanna go!

08:05.010 --> 08:08.610
Then, could I ask you two to go,
 Nacchan and Luke?

08:08.610 --> 08:09.450
Huh?

08:08.610 --> 08:09.450
Sure.

08:09.450 --> 08:11.750
Q and Unio, you can go 
to the South District.

08:11.750 --> 08:14.710
Memmeln and I will take the North District.

08:14.710 --> 08:17.660
I-I-I'll go! I'll go to Despair, too!

08:22.070 --> 08:24.550
The District of Despair?

08:24.550 --> 08:27.300
This wasn't in the reference material.

08:27.640 --> 08:29.580
I had no idea this place existed.

08:30.320 --> 08:33.260
It's the most dangerous part of the slums.

08:33.260 --> 08:36.810
They say only despair awaits
when you live here.

08:37.080 --> 08:39.740
The Soul Future's light doesn't reach here.

08:39.740 --> 08:42.130
Once all the Voids are gone 
and the world's at peace,

08:42.130 --> 08:45.680
I'd first like to do something 
for all the people living here.

08:45.680 --> 08:48.610
Huh. I never knew you thought 
about things like that.

08:48.970 --> 08:50.710
I guess you're unexpectedly mature.

08:51.090 --> 08:52.810
What do you mean, "unexpectedly"?

08:53.180 --> 08:54.300
I'm an adult.

08:54.300 --> 08:56.880
Huh? What's this? Are you embarrassed?

08:56.880 --> 08:58.090
I am not embarrassed!

08:58.310 --> 09:00.220
Look, Luke!

09:00.220 --> 09:03.490
It's poop! There's horse poop 
in the middle of the road!

09:03.490 --> 09:06.090
Wow, it's huge!

09:05.060 --> 09:08.310
Actually, are there even kids here?

09:06.090 --> 09:08.630
Dang! It's so big!

09:08.630 --> 09:11.570
Come on, Luke! Look over here!

09:17.420 --> 09:18.850
What the heck is this?

09:19.750 --> 09:21.920
Let go! Let go of me!

09:22.380 --> 09:24.490
Huh? The great hero?

09:24.880 --> 09:25.890
The great hero?

09:25.890 --> 09:26.450
Huh?

09:26.450 --> 09:27.340
You're right!

09:27.340 --> 09:27.720
Huh?

09:27.720 --> 09:29.570
It's the Nine Soldiers!

09:29.570 --> 09:30.210
Huh?

09:30.860 --> 09:33.440
If you let your guard down, 
they'll get you again.

09:33.440 --> 09:35.790
Crime is a daily occurrence for them.

09:35.790 --> 09:37.830
It's the only way they can survive.

09:43.600 --> 09:45.340
Don't bare your fangs like that.

09:45.340 --> 09:48.340
Come on, there's plenty 
for everyone, so line up.

09:48.340 --> 09:52.110
Hey, Natsuko! Get to work!

09:50.740 --> 09:52.110
Whoa!

09:52.110 --> 09:53.870
It's Chingosman!

09:54.240 --> 09:56.100
Draw some other Nine Soldiers!

09:54.790 --> 09:57.420
They're all happy. Let them be.

09:56.100 --> 09:57.190
Who do you want?

09:57.190 --> 09:58.360
Um...

09:57.420 --> 09:58.380
Hmph!

09:58.360 --> 09:59.350
Luke!

09:59.370 --> 10:00.800
Draw Luke!

10:00.800 --> 10:02.360
Really?

10:02.360 --> 10:03.300
Draw Justice!

10:03.300 --> 10:04.240
Ooh, good one.

10:04.240 --> 10:07.240
Hey, Luke! Let me see your sword!

10:06.300 --> 10:08.980
Show us your sword! Come on!

10:07.880 --> 10:08.980
Show us!

10:08.980 --> 10:13.320
More importantly, if you go to Serval 
Cat House, you'll get delicious meals...

10:12.480 --> 10:13.750
Hey!

10:13.750 --> 10:15.330
Fly!

10:13.750 --> 10:15.750
Don't go touching my horn!

10:15.330 --> 10:17.250
Let me ride you!

10:15.750 --> 10:17.250
A unicorn's horn is his life!

10:17.250 --> 10:19.930
If it breaks, I won't be
 able to fly anymore!

10:20.470 --> 10:23.640
This is why I don't like kids.

10:23.960 --> 10:25.510
Good grief.

10:28.240 --> 10:29.410
Is it good?

10:30.910 --> 10:34.470
There's a place where you can 
eat yummy food every day.

10:34.470 --> 10:35.540
And that's...

10:36.550 --> 10:39.040
Serval Cat House!

10:39.350 --> 10:43.480
Children have the right 
to eat yummy food every day.

10:43.480 --> 10:45.030
They can eat without working.

10:46.580 --> 10:49.530
Do you want to continue stealing 
for the rest of your life?

10:52.850 --> 10:55.520
Whose place are you all at right now?

10:55.520 --> 10:56.190
You there.

10:56.190 --> 10:56.870
Huh?

10:57.100 --> 11:00.880
Um, Chingosman's place?

11:01.310 --> 11:02.250
Correct.

11:02.250 --> 11:03.140
Yay!

11:03.670 --> 11:06.860
To get from Chingosman to Serval Cat House,

11:06.860 --> 11:10.040
you have to go down 
Justice's road like "boom,"

11:10.040 --> 11:12.530
then make a turn at Ganger like "bam"!

11:12.880 --> 11:15.060
Just look for this Serval Cat sign.

11:15.440 --> 11:18.910
The adults here aren't your enemy. 
They're all your friends.

11:18.910 --> 11:20.220
Really?

11:20.220 --> 11:22.410
Who do you think I am?

11:22.620 --> 11:24.400
We produce reliability and results:

11:24.790 --> 11:26.160
Nine...

11:26.160 --> 11:27.380
Soldiers!

11:29.810 --> 11:31.800
If you go here, you can eat...

11:32.120 --> 11:33.680
...yummy food!

11:33.950 --> 11:35.270
Even if you don't work...

11:35.270 --> 11:36.670
...we can eat!

11:36.670 --> 11:38.370
The Serval Cat...

11:38.370 --> 11:40.050
...isn't our enemy!

11:40.050 --> 11:42.930
Come to Serval Cat House and shake my hand!

11:43.170 --> 11:45.910
Let's eat some more yummy food tomorrow!

11:45.910 --> 11:47.450
Yeah!

11:47.450 --> 11:48.650
Serval Cat...

11:48.650 --> 11:49.760
...House!

11:49.760 --> 11:50.780
Serval Cat...

11:50.780 --> 11:51.840
...House!

11:51.840 --> 11:52.930
Serval Cat...

11:52.930 --> 11:53.980
...House!

11:53.980 --> 11:54.890
Serval Cat...

11:54.890 --> 11:56.110
...House!

11:57.500 --> 11:58.940
Wow.

11:59.250 --> 12:02.660
Seriously, what's with her?

12:09.040 --> 12:11.470
Ugh, my legs are so swollen.

12:11.470 --> 12:15.950
How many times did we dash from Serval Cat 
House to the District of Despair and back?

12:16.190 --> 12:18.100
The kids really love you.

12:18.100 --> 12:21.540
Pfft. She's just close in mental age to them.

12:21.540 --> 12:24.090
Heh. Are you actually jealous of me?

12:24.090 --> 12:24.980
Wha—

12:24.980 --> 12:27.050
Wh-Wh-Who would ever be jealous of <i>you</i>?

12:27.050 --> 12:29.060
Pay up already!

12:29.060 --> 12:31.310
You stupid lizard!

12:32.870 --> 12:33.810
Stop!

12:34.550 --> 12:36.420
Tch, it's the hero.

12:36.420 --> 12:37.550
Damn it.

12:43.830 --> 12:46.310
I see you haven't changed, Justice.

12:46.310 --> 12:46.960
Huh?

12:47.240 --> 12:51.110
It's hard to believe you were once 
a dragon who could breathe fire and fight.

12:51.110 --> 12:52.330
Justice?

12:53.700 --> 12:55.320
<i>The</i> Justice?

12:55.660 --> 12:58.950
Well, well, if it isn't 
the great Nine Soldiers.

12:59.600 --> 13:02.200
So honored to be in your presence.

13:04.300 --> 13:07.870
Looks like you found yourselves a cutie-pie.

13:07.870 --> 13:09.910
So soft and...

13:10.630 --> 13:12.390
she smells nice.

13:17.780 --> 13:18.840
Let's go.

13:24.900 --> 13:29.950
Little lady, come by anytime if you 
ever want to spread your wings with me.

13:29.950 --> 13:31.620
I'll play with you.

13:36.120 --> 13:38.580
You ran into Justice?

13:38.580 --> 13:39.670
Yeah.

13:40.370 --> 13:42.230
Oh, so that's why.

13:49.500 --> 13:50.810
Damn it!

13:51.850 --> 13:57.890
Luke looked up to Justice more 
than anyone else in the Nine Soldiers.

13:57.890 --> 14:00.400
So Justice lives there?

14:00.400 --> 14:01.860
I'm not sure.

14:01.860 --> 14:06.850
I heard that dragon was getting by working 
as a bodyguard at an illegal gambling parlor.

14:07.170 --> 14:08.970
That's just a rumor, though.

14:09.960 --> 14:11.360
Serval Cat...

14:11.360 --> 14:12.470
...House!

14:12.470 --> 14:13.490
Serval Cat...

14:13.490 --> 14:14.430
...House!

14:14.430 --> 14:15.580
Serval Cat...

14:15.580 --> 14:16.460
...House!

14:16.460 --> 14:17.480
Serval Cat...

14:17.480 --> 14:18.490
...House!

14:22.090 --> 14:25.090
You here to do some illegal gambling?

14:25.090 --> 14:28.730
Or did you come to play with me?

14:31.300 --> 14:32.240
Wa—

14:33.560 --> 14:35.050
Water.

14:38.230 --> 14:42.120
Running around taking kids
 to an orphanage, huh?

14:42.120 --> 14:45.550
Must be rough being
 one of the Nine Soldiers.

14:45.550 --> 14:47.870
I wanted to see you.

14:47.870 --> 14:50.300
Well, what a coincidence.

14:50.300 --> 14:52.230
I wanted to see you, too...

14:52.490 --> 14:54.080
cutie-pie.

14:55.200 --> 14:58.240
In the battle where the 
eighth Soul Future was lost,

14:58.240 --> 15:03.620
Luke took command and rescued the people
 of the town as it was being destroyed.

15:05.580 --> 15:07.330
Ganger!

15:07.640 --> 15:13.900
As a result, Ganger died and 
you were gravely injured. But...

15:14.540 --> 15:17.170
Stop talking. You'll only
cough up more magma.

15:17.170 --> 15:20.600
Luke didn't know you'd also gotten hurt.

15:27.960 --> 15:32.160
And without telling Luke 
and the others about that,

15:32.160 --> 15:34.320
you quit the Nine Soldiers.

15:35.850 --> 15:39.290
I see you've got quite 
the imagination, little lady.

15:39.650 --> 15:42.770
More importantly, 
wanna fool around with me?

15:45.350 --> 15:46.540
I knew it.

15:48.260 --> 15:49.680
You can't fly.

15:55.790 --> 15:57.520
Oh, come on!

15:57.520 --> 15:59.510
You're gonna break my horn!

15:59.510 --> 16:01.520
A unicorn's horn is his life!

16:01.520 --> 16:03.630
Natsuko's taking a while.

16:02.480 --> 16:04.150
Stop that!

16:04.000 --> 16:06.030
Why don't you tell them the truth?

16:06.030 --> 16:08.450
You're okay with Luke hating you forever?

16:13.400 --> 16:18.400
Even though it wasn't his fault, 
he'll feel like it was and blame himself.

16:18.720 --> 16:20.620
That's just how he is.

16:22.050 --> 16:30.290
If he's going to blame himself, 
I'd rather just have him hate me.

16:36.110 --> 16:39.030
Should you be wasting your time here?

16:39.030 --> 16:41.460
The Voids may show up.

16:41.460 --> 16:43.220
I can beat the Voids in no time.

16:43.900 --> 16:45.680
Well, aren't you confident?

16:45.680 --> 16:49.120
We're not the same Nine Soldiers 
from when you were around.

16:49.120 --> 16:51.630
Man, my shoulders are stiff.

16:52.570 --> 16:55.550
Say, are there any hot springs around here?

16:55.550 --> 16:56.940
Hot springs?

16:57.380 --> 17:00.480
I haven't had a soak in a bath since I got here.

17:00.480 --> 17:02.200
You mean a spring of hot water?

17:02.200 --> 17:05.580
Man, I just want to relax in a hot spring.

17:05.580 --> 17:08.470
Hubris might lead to your downfall.

17:12.190 --> 17:13.110
So good.

17:13.850 --> 17:14.900
Stay still.

17:16.150 --> 17:17.370
Don't move.

17:18.580 --> 17:25.100
I had no idea you'd gotten so sexy 
after becoming such a failure.

17:25.370 --> 17:28.050
You're really saying that to my face?

17:28.050 --> 17:29.110
It's kinda hot.

17:29.930 --> 17:34.530
Oho, I see. So that's their relationship.

17:34.530 --> 17:36.400
Their relationship?

17:36.400 --> 17:38.780
An "adult" relationship.

17:40.080 --> 17:42.630
An "adult" relationship?

17:50.750 --> 17:53.390
It's all thanks to you, Nine Soldiers.

17:53.390 --> 17:56.570
Thank you so much for bringing everyone.

17:58.010 --> 17:59.280
This is Justice.

17:59.280 --> 18:00.510
Wow!

18:00.510 --> 18:01.730
So cool!

18:01.730 --> 18:02.890
Justice is cool, huh?

18:02.890 --> 18:04.230
A Void response!

18:04.510 --> 18:06.510
Void response! Void response!

18:06.510 --> 18:07.190
Where?

18:07.190 --> 18:08.620
South of the main gate!

18:08.620 --> 18:09.640
Let's go.

18:11.860 --> 18:13.900
Be careful, everyone.

18:14.510 --> 18:15.730
It's no use.

18:16.440 --> 18:18.410
Even with all these corrections, it's no use.

18:19.790 --> 18:20.820
Natsuko!

18:31.480 --> 18:33.310
Those are Voids?

18:33.310 --> 18:34.930
They aren't moving.

18:34.930 --> 18:36.720
Are they really Voids?

18:36.720 --> 18:38.710
The Void response is off the charts.

18:38.710 --> 18:41.250
I didn't see those in the movie.

18:42.260 --> 18:43.540
What should we do?

18:43.540 --> 18:45.170
I'll go take a look.

18:46.230 --> 18:47.940
All of you stay here.

18:47.940 --> 18:50.280
Don't attack until I give the signal.

18:50.280 --> 18:52.190
QJ, come with me.

18:52.190 --> 18:53.300
Roger.

19:01.430 --> 19:02.190
Draw..

19:02.960 --> 19:04.970
You need to draw, Natsuko.

19:09.570 --> 19:12.900
QJ, get an aerial view and 
see what you can find out.

19:12.900 --> 19:14.210
Understood.

19:15.840 --> 19:16.950
Huh?

19:16.950 --> 19:18.220
Natsuko-san!

19:18.220 --> 19:20.730
I can take care of that myself.

19:20.730 --> 19:22.180
I said to stay there!

19:22.180 --> 19:23.150
Don't get in my way.

19:23.150 --> 19:24.180
Natsuko!

19:24.180 --> 19:27.120
It's fine. Leave this to me.

19:27.630 --> 19:29.230
I'll do it all myself.

19:29.690 --> 19:32.950
It'll just be faster in the end.

20:23.530 --> 20:24.400
Done!

20:31.800 --> 20:34.040
Now, to battle!

20:51.060 --> 20:52.220
She did it.

21:01.940 --> 21:02.460
Huh?

21:02.460 --> 21:03.840
That was too short.

21:03.840 --> 21:05.480
Additional animation required.

21:07.040 --> 21:09.200
QJ, back up Natsuko!

21:09.200 --> 21:09.960
Roger!

21:10.150 --> 21:13.750
Memmeln and Unio, use defense magic 
to stop that thing getting to the town!

21:14.670 --> 21:15.860
Roger!

21:34.020 --> 21:36.380
The Void response is getting stronger!

21:38.610 --> 21:40.160
I'll do it all myself.

21:40.530 --> 21:43.160
It'll just be faster in the end.

21:58.890 --> 21:59.700
Huh?

22:09.000 --> 22:10.020
Natsuko!

22:12.770 --> 22:15.600
Natsuko!

23:49.990 --> 23:54.900
<b>Episode 6: CHANGE</b>
